  <Description>Icecream64 is a modern 64-bit VST3 synthesizer for Windows, inspired by the original IceCream plugin by Cosmic Boy.

This project preserves the playful character and hands-on workflow of the original while adding a resizable interface, light and dark themes, portable settings, and a number of refinements. It is a homage rather than an exact replica.</Description>
